<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">yes, we are on the way!</font></b></font></font>

29
00:01:21,950 --> 00:01:28,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I WANNA ROCKS mune ni ROCKS</font></b></font></font>

30
00:01:21,950 --> 00:01:28,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I wanna rock... Rockin' my heart...</font></b></font></font>

31
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:49,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think we almost finished
shaking off the losers.</font>

32
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:51,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I guess I'll move
onto the main issue.</font>

33
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It has been 45 minutes, so I'll start.</font>

34
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:57,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

35
00:01:58,800 --> 00:02:01,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here is the tenth question!</font>

36
00:02:03,510 --> 00:02:04,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here it comes!</font>

37
00:02:04,850 --> 00:02:07,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to put everything on
the line for this question!</font>

38
00:02:08,980 --> 00:02:14,980
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">An off-the-cuff</font>

39
00:02:08,980 --> 00:02:14,980
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">match!</font>

40
00:02:08,980 --> 00:02:14,980
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The 10th Question That</font>

41
00:02:08,980 --> 00:02:14,980
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">We Must Hold Out On</font>

42
00:02:17,570 --> 00:02:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmph! Making such a big deal.</font>

43
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:23,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the final obstacle.</font>

44
00:02:24,370 --> 00:02:26,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kankuro, come back already!</font>

45
00:02:26,830 --> 00:02:30,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he starts the tenth question,
your cheat sheet has no meaning!</font>

46
00:02:31,130 --> 00:02:34,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But before that,</font>

47
00:02:35,050 --> 00:02:39,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to add
some rules for the last question.</font>

48
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:53,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aren't you lucky?</font>

49
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:58,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like playing with
the dolls wasn't a waste, after all?</font>

50
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy.</font>

51
00:03:00,700 --> 00:03:02,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's figured Crow out!</font>

52
00:03:03,490 --> 00:03:05,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, sit down.</font>

53
00:03:21,760 --> 00:03:23,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me explain!</font>

54
00:03:24,470 --> 00:03:25,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These are</font>

55
00:03:27,470 --> 00:03:29,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the hopeless rules!</font>

56
00:03:33,770 --> 00:03:35,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, anyhow.</font>

57
00:03:35,820 --> 00:03:38,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's nothing to do when
the subordinates are gone, huh?</font>

58
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:42,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it'll get busy soon enough.</font>

59
00:03:43,570 --> 00:03:44,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?</font>

60
00:03:46,830 --> 00:03:48,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This year's first proctor...</font>

61
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:51,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hear it's that Morino Ibiki.</font>

62
00:03:53,710 --> 00:03:56,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then, passing the first exam
already seems iffy.</font>

63
00:03:58,550 --> 00:04:01,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of all the people, that sadist...</font>

64
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:02,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sadist?</font>

65
00:04:03,260 --> 00:04:09,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kurenai, you're a new Jonin,
so you wouldn't know.</font>

66
00:04:11,100 --> 00:04:12,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is this person?</font>

67
00:04:14,100 --> 00:04:16,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is a pro, a professional.</font>

68
00:04:17,060 --> 00:04:19,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Professional? Of what?</font>

69
00:04:25,950 --> 00:04:28,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Torture and interrogation.</font>

70
00:04:28,990 --> 00:04:29,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

71
00:04:30,700 --> 00:04:35,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, there maybe no physical torture
in the exam itself,</font>

72
00:04:35,370 --> 00:04:38,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but he's sure to use his
his skills as an interrogator</font>

73
00:04:38,170 --> 00:04:41,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to torment them psychologically.</font>

74
00:04:43,050 --> 00:04:44,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is...</font>

75
00:04:45,470 --> 00:04:49,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf Village ANBU's
Torture and Interrogation Unit Marshall,</font>

76
00:04:50,430 --> 00:04:51,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Morino Ibiki!</font>

77
00:04:56,310 --> 00:04:58,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hopeless rules...?!</font>

78
00:05:00,530 --> 00:05:02,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, you guys will have to choose</font>

79
00:05:03,190 --> 00:05:08,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">whether or not you will take
this 10th question!</font>

80
00:05:08,620 --> 00:05:09,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

81
00:05:11,290 --> 00:05:13,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choose whether or not
to take the exam?</font>

82
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, choose?!</font>

83
00:05:16,370 --> 00:05:19,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happens if you choose not
to take the 10th exam?</font>

84
00:05:19,500 --> 00:05:25,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you chose not to take the exam,
then your score will be zero.</font>

85
00:05:26,470 --> 00:05:28,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, you fail!</font>

86
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:31,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And of course, the same goes for
the two others in the same group!</font>

87
00:05:32,470 --> 00:05:33,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What does that mean!</font>

88
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:36,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course, everybody is going to
choose to take the exam!</font>

89
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:38,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is ridiculous!
As if we have a choice!</font>

90
00:05:39,270 --> 00:05:43,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... one more rule...</font>

91
00:05:43,570 --> 00:05:44,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Another one?!</font>

92
00:05:45,070 --> 00:05:46,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Finish with it already!</font>

93
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:50,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you chose to take it and
are unable to answer it correctly,</font>

94
00:05:51,660 --> 00:05:53,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then you will have to...</font>

95
00:05:55,250 --> 00:05:59,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">relinquish your right
of taking the Chunin Exam forever.</font>

96
00:06:02,550 --> 00:06:04,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What kind of ridiculous rule is that?!</font>

97
00:06:05,050 --> 00:06:07,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, there are plenty
of people here</font>

98
00:06:07,510 --> 00:06:09,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who have taken the
Chunin Exam many times!</font>

99
00:06:17,350 --> 00:06:20,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're just unlucky.</font>

100
00:06:22,400 --> 00:06:24,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I make the rule this year.</font>

101
00:06:26,940 --> 00:06:30,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I did give you
the option to go back!</font>

102
00:06:32,740 --> 00:06:36,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For those of you who aren't confident,
you can choose not to take it</font>

103
00:06:36,250 --> 00:06:39,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and take the exam
next year or the year after that.</font>

104
00:06:42,710 --> 00:06:44,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! How terrible!</font>

105
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:48,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If one out of the three
chooses not to take the exam,</font>

106
00:06:48,420 --> 00:06:50,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then all three will be failed.</font>

107
00:06:51,890 --> 00:06:55,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you do choose to take it,
but get the wrong answer...</font>

108
00:06:55,430 --> 00:06:57,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then that person will be a
Genin for the rest of their life!</font>

109
00:06:58,640 --> 00:07:00,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter what,
the odds are against us!</font>

110
00:07:01,310 --> 00:07:03,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's an impossible choice
for anyone with normal nerves!</font>

111
00:07:08,780 --> 00:07:10,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, let's begin...</font>

112
00:07:11,910 --> 00:07:13,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The 10th question...</font>

113
00:07:13,870 --> 00:07:16,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who will not be taking it,
raise your hands!</font>

114
00:07:17,700 --> 00:07:20,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once I confirm your number,
I'll ask you to leave!</font>

115
00:07:27,170 --> 00:07:30,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What kind of a question
is it going to be....?</font>

116
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:31,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

117
00:07:32,010 --> 00:07:34,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I get it wrong,
I'll be a Genin for the rest of my life.</font>

118
00:07:34,550 --> 00:07:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want that!</font>

119
00:07:35,810 --> 00:07:38,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if I choose not take it...!</font>

120
00:07:38,100 --> 00:07:42,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then I'll fail Sasuke and Sakura-chan, too!
I don't want that either!</font>

121
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:44,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't raise my hand!</font>

122
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:48,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm confident that
I can answer it correctly.</font>

123
00:07:49,900 --> 00:07:50,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

124
00:07:52,150 --> 00:07:54,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Naruto! You're different!</font>

125
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:58,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should retreat this time
even if it means to ignore us</font>

126
00:07:58,870 --> 00:08:01,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and think of your next chance
to take the Exam!</font>

127
00:08:04,580 --> 00:08:08,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... I...</font>

128
00:08:10,130 --> 00:08:12,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm quitting!
I'm not going to take it!</font>

129
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:15,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">#50 failed!</font>

130
00:08:16,430 --> 00:08:20,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">#130, #111 will be
failed as well...</font>

131
00:08:21,930 --> 00:08:24,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I'm sorry...
Gennai! Inaho!</font>

132
00:08:28,230 --> 00:08:29,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn...</font>

133
00:08:29,860 --> 00:08:30,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">M-Me too!</font>

134
00:08:33,450 --> 00:08:34,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me too!</font>

135
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:47,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

136
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:50,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you raise your hand?</font>

137
00:08:56,220 --> 00:08:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy...</font>

138
00:08:57,970 --> 00:08:59,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am the super elite ninja</font>

139
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:01,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who will be carrying
the name of the Hokage!</font>

140
00:09:01,430 --> 00:09:05,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My name is Uzumaki Naruto,
remember that!</font>

141
00:09:06,060 --> 00:09:07,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

142
00:09:08,150 --> 00:09:12,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm prepared to do anything
to become a Hokage!</font>

143
00:09:12,650 --> 00:09:14,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will surpass the Hokage!</font>

144
00:09:14,400 --> 00:09:17,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I will make all of
the people in the village</font>

145
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:19,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">acknowledge my presence!</font>

146
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:26,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's always got such a one-track mind.</font>

147
00:09:26,830 --> 00:09:29,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Saying Hokage, Hokage
all the time like a fool.</font>

148
00:09:32,670 --> 00:09:34,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, Naruto.</font>

149
00:09:35,220 --> 00:09:36,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems like...</font>

150
00:09:36,630 --> 00:09:38,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want to...</font>

151
00:09:42,140 --> 00:09:43,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">crush your unachievable dreams.</font>

152
00:10:22,300 --> 00:10:23,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy...</font>

153
00:10:26,020 --> 00:10:29,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ibiki completely understands how
the human psyche works.</font>

154
00:10:30,350 --> 00:10:33,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the most horrifying part is...</font>

155
00:10:33,980 --> 00:10:39,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that by cornering people psychologically
he controls their psyche and</font>

156
00:10:40,870 --> 00:10:44,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">reveals the fundamental
weakness of a human.</font>

157
00:10:55,340 --> 00:10:58,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't underestimate me!
I won't run!</font>

158
00:10:59,800 --> 00:11:00,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take it!</font>

159
00:11:01,340 --> 00:11:03,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But even if I'm stuck being
a Genin forever,</font>

160
00:11:04,140 --> 00:11:07,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will become a Hokage
no matter what it takes!</font>

161
00:11:10,730 --> 00:11:12,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not scared!</font>

162
00:11:19,860 --> 00:11:24,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy, he wasn't even
thinking of us at all.</font>

163
00:11:24,870 --> 00:11:26,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such audacity!</font>

164
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:28,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

165
00:11:28,540 --> 00:11:30,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's exactly the kind of fool you are!</font>

166
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:34,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll ask again.</font>

167
00:11:36,050 --> 00:11:38,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a choice that will alter your life.</font>

168
00:11:39,010 --> 00:11:40,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you want to quit, now is your chance!</font>

169
00:11:41,340 --> 00:11:44,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not going to take back
my words!</font>

170
00:11:44,680 --> 00:11:46,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is my Ninja Way!</font>

171
00:11:55,270 --> 00:11:58,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh... What a funny kid.</font>

172
00:11:58,820 --> 00:12:02,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He completely brushed away
those kids' anxieties.</font>

173
00:12:04,410 --> 00:12:08,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">78, huh? Much more left
than I expected.</font>

174
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:12,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's going to be the same.
No matter how much more I push it.</font>

175
00:12:21,130 --> 00:12:22,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I like your determination!</font>

176
00:12:23,470 --> 00:12:24,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then...</font>

177
00:12:25,390 --> 00:12:27,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For those who are still here...</font>

178
00:12:28,390 --> 00:12:29,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The first exam...</font>

179
00:12:33,140 --> 00:12:35,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have passed it!</font>

180
00:12:41,650 --> 00:12:42,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

181
00:12:43,820 --> 00:12:46,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey, what does that mean?</font>

182
00:12:46,410 --> 00:12:48,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All of a sudden you're telling us
that we've passed!</font>

183
00:12:48,330 --> 00:12:49,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What about the 10th question?</font>

184
00:12:52,580 --> 00:12:55,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There wasn't such
a thing to begin with!</font>

185
00:12:55,540 --> 00:12:58,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, you can look at the choice you
just had to make as the 10th question!</font>

186
00:12:59,340 --> 00:13:00,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

187
00:13:00,300 --> 00:13:01,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

188
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:04,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, what were all
those nine questions for!</font>

189
00:13:04,970 --> 00:13:06,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was just a waste of time!</font>

190
00:13:06,390 --> 00:13:07,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not a waste...</font>

191
00:13:08,470 --> 00:13:12,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The objective of the nine questions
were already accomplished.</font>

192
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:19,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To test your individual ability
to gather information!</font>

193
00:13:20,940 --> 00:13:22,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ability to gather information?</font>

194
00:13:23,690 --> 00:13:24,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First...</font>

195
00:13:25,110 --> 00:13:27,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The focus of this test was</font>

196
00:13:27,070 --> 00:13:29,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">on the system of determining
the pass or failure</font>

197
00:13:29,450 --> 00:13:33,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">based on the three-person groups
that was proposed in the first rule.</font>

198
00:13:34,660 --> 00:13:36,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By grading the exam on
a group basis,</font>

199
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:41,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I added the unimaginable pressure
of dragging down your teammates.</font>

200
00:13:43,670 --> 00:13:44,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, I see.</font>

201
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:48,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I kind of felt that was
the point of this test!</font>

202
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:50,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, you didn't!</font>

203
00:13:52,890 --> 00:13:53,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

204
00:13:54,180 --> 00:13:56,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The questions on these tests weren't
things that</font>

205
00:13:56,270 --> 00:13:59,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you Genin Ninja would
have been able to solve...</font>

206
00:13:59,980 --> 00:14:02,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So in that case...</font>

207
00:14:02,900 --> 00:14:06,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I imagined that most of you here
would have come to this conclusion:</font>

208
00:14:06,490 --> 00:14:09,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"In order to score points,
I'll have to cheat."</font>

209
00:14:10,780 --> 00:14:11,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,</font>

210
00:14:11,700 --> 00:14:14,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this exam was created under the premise
that you all would cheat!</font>

211
00:14:25,630 --> 00:14:28,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That being said,</font>

212
00:14:28,720 --> 00:14:31,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had two Chunin in the group
who knew all of the answers</font>

213
00:14:31,850 --> 00:14:34,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from whom you could cheat.</font>

214
00:14:35,220 --> 00:14:38,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! That's what it was?</font>

215
00:14:39,140 --> 00:14:41,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had a hard time figuring
out the guy.</font>

216
00:14:41,310 --> 00:14:43,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. Really...</font>

217
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:47,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was so obvious!</font>

218
00:14:47,240 --> 00:14:49,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's something wrong with you
if you didn't notice!</font>

219
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:50,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, Hinata?!</font>

220
00:14:51,660 --> 00:14:55,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He... didn't realize it...</font>

221
00:14:55,740 --> 00:14:57,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

222
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:02,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">those who just foolishly cheated,
naturally were disqualified.</font>

223
00:15:04,550 --> 00:15:05,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's because...</font>

224
00:15:06,340 --> 00:15:08,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Information, depending on
the time and situation,</font>

225
00:15:08,880 --> 00:15:11,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it will be more valuable than life.</font>

226
00:15:11,510 --> 00:15:13,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And in a mission or on a battlefield,</font>

227
00:15:15,430 --> 00:15:18,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you will always have to risk your life
to fight for it!</font>

228
00:15:19,980 --> 00:15:24,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Horrible burn marks, nail punctures
and scratches...</font>

229
00:15:25,020 --> 00:15:26,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those are signs of physical torture!</font>

230
00:15:31,530 --> 00:15:33,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When information is gathered</font>

231
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:35,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the enemy or a third party
finds out about it,</font>

232
00:15:35,410 --> 00:15:38,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that information is no longer
guaranteed to be correct.</font>

233
00:15:41,210 --> 00:15:43,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just remember this.</font>

234
00:15:44,960 --> 00:15:47,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To be given the wrong information</font>

235
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:51,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">can bring a catastrophic blow
to your friends and town.</font>

236
00:15:52,930 --> 00:15:55,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that is why, out of necessity,
we forced you guys to cheat</font>

237
00:15:56,050 --> 00:15:58,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in order to test your ability
to collect information.</font>

238
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:04,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And we filtered out those who
were clearly lacking in those abilities.</font>

239
00:16:05,110 --> 00:16:06,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

240
00:16:06,440 --> 00:16:09,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The last question doesn't
make any sense.</font>

241
00:16:09,940 --> 00:16:11,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

242
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:16,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this 10th question was
the main issue of this first exam.</font>

243
00:16:17,080 --> 00:16:17,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

244
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:20,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?</font>

245
00:16:20,540 --> 00:16:21,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll explain.</font>

246
00:16:22,290 --> 00:16:25,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The tenth question was to
take on the question, or not.</font>

247
00:16:27,090 --> 00:16:31,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Needless to say, it is
a painful decision to make.</font>

248
00:16:32,470 --> 00:16:33,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who chose not to
take on the question,</font>

249
00:16:33,760 --> 00:16:36,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">would be immediately failed
along with their whole squad!</font>

250
00:16:36,390 --> 00:16:40,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who chose to answer
the question and got it wrong...</font>

251
00:16:41,270 --> 00:16:44,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">would be robbed of their chance
to take the Exam forever.</font>

252
00:16:45,060 --> 00:16:47,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It really is an unfair question.</font>

253
00:16:51,530 --> 00:16:54,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, how about these two choices?</font>

254
00:16:54,820 --> 00:16:57,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's say that you guys did
become a Chunin.</font>

255
00:16:58,660 --> 00:17:01,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The mission is to steal
a secret document!</font>

256
00:17:02,910 --> 00:17:04,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have no idea how many
Ninja the enemy has,</font>

257
00:17:04,500 --> 00:17:07,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">their ability, and other armament
they may have.</font>

258
00:17:08,750 --> 00:17:12,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On top of that, there maybe
the pitfall of an enemy trap.</font>

259
00:17:13,590 --> 00:17:17,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now this mission...
Will you take it? Or not take it?</font>

260
00:17:17,720 --> 00:17:19,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because you want your life spared...</font>

261
00:17:19,470 --> 00:17:21,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because your partners will
be put in danger...</font>

262
00:17:22,600 --> 00:17:24,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you get away from
dangerous missions?</font>

263
00:17:25,890 --> 00:17:26,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The answer is...</font>

264
00:17:30,150 --> 00:17:30,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

265
00:17:32,730 --> 00:17:34,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are going to be missions
you cannot avoid</font>

266
00:17:34,700 --> 00:17:36,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no matter how risky or
dangerous it may be!</font>

267
00:17:39,490 --> 00:17:42,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Showing your courage to
your teammates in a tight spot,</font>

268
00:17:42,700 --> 00:17:44,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the ability to get through
the hardships...</font>

269
00:17:48,130 --> 00:17:51,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the quality that is needed
in a Chunin troop leader!</font>

270
00:17:56,470 --> 00:18:00,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In a pinch, there are
those who cannot risk their own fate,</font>

271
00:18:01,260 --> 00:18:05,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and those who waver and give up
their chances</font>

272
00:18:05,180 --> 00:18:09,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because they think they
will have another chance.</font>

273
00:18:10,110 --> 00:18:13,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I believe that such fools who don't have
strong determination</font>

274
00:18:13,820 --> 00:18:17,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">have no right to become a Chunin!</font>

275
00:18:19,360 --> 00:18:21,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For those of you who chose
to take on the question,</font>

276
00:18:21,280 --> 00:18:24,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you can say that you have successfully
answered the difficult 10th question!</font>

277
00:18:26,040 --> 00:18:29,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You shall be able to take on
the adversity that may lie in your way.</font>

278
00:18:31,210 --> 00:18:32,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've passed through the gates!</font>

279
00:18:34,170 --> 00:18:37,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The first exam for the Chunin Exam
has been completed.</font>

280
00:18:38,760 --> 00:18:41,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wish you well!</font>

281
00:18:41,850 --> 00:18:44,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Wish us well!</font>

282
00:18:44,600 --> 00:18:47,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did it! I did it!
Yeah!</font>

283
00:18:49,140 --> 00:18:50,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a funny guy...</font>

284
00:19:01,410 --> 00:19:02,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's going on?!</font>

285
00:19:07,120 --> 00:19:09,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gosh, this one...</font>

286
00:19:09,540 --> 00:19:10,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys!</font>

287
00:19:11,040 --> 00:19:13,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't the time to be
celebrating!</font>

288
00:19:15,250 --> 00:19:18,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the proctor for the second exam!
Mitarashi Anko!</font>

289
00:19:19,760 --> 00:19:22,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's move onto
the next stage! Next!</font>

290
00:19:22,340 --> 00:19:24,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Follow me!</font>

291
00:19:30,770 --> 00:19:32,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Read the atmosphere.</font>

292
00:19:35,610 --> 00:19:38,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This proctor...
Is kind of like Naruto.</font>

293
00:19:39,860 --> 00:19:44,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">78?! Ibiki!
You let 26 teams slide by?</font>

294
00:19:45,370 --> 00:19:48,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess, the first exam this time around
was too easy.</font>

295
00:19:49,160 --> 00:19:52,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems like this time,
there are a lot of excellent candidates.</font>

296
00:19:53,130 --> 00:19:55,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh! Well, all right...</font>

297
00:19:56,670 --> 00:20:00,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll drop more than half of them
in the second exam!</font>

298
00:20:01,170 --> 00:20:03,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">M-More than half?</font>

299
00:20:04,220 --> 00:20:06,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm getting excited.</font>

300
00:20:07,510 --> 00:20:09,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll give you the details tomorrow.</font>

301
00:20:09,350 --> 00:20:11,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll be changing locations,</font>

302
00:20:11,140 --> 00:20:15,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so get information from your Jonin
about the location and the time!</font>

303
00:20:16,110 --> 00:20:17,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it. You're dismissed.</font>

304
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:41,300
